[54.321973, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m$ python3 -m nexportal_gate gate 11 --repo jbreyc/nxu-nexportal\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[58.611407, "o", "gate: #11 → needs-info — shape: open-question — NX-OPEN-QUESTION: BLOCKING — Define 'past the first phase' as a rule the team can check: which fact about the learner flips it (completed first term? first course? earned first credential? N weeks enrolled?). The team does not own this concept and cannot pick it for you. (owner: requester)\r\n"]
